# Runtime dependencies of the provider image: rill-provider and the rill CLI.
# The local packages are installed from source without dependencies; only
# their third-party dependencies are locked, with hashes, in requirements.txt.
# Regenerate it with ./lock.sh. Paths are relative to the repository root.
./rill-provider
./rill-cli
./rill-core/packages/core
./rill-crypto/python
